    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you on the vitamin k thing, but i feel like i've read online that as long as you're consistent it's fine. so if i just make sure i have my big green smoothie every single morning, wouldn't that just keep my levels steady? i'm just really motivated to get these nutrients in right now and it seems like the most efficient way to do it. wouldn't that be okay since i'd be consistent?",
